      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report the C4-selective C-H alkylation of carbazole derivatives furnished with a pyrimidine directing group at N9. This was realized using ruthenium catalyzed σ-activation methodology, whereby C-H activation at C1 enables the interaction of this ruthenacycle, at the para position to the metal center, with tertiary alkyl radicals."},
